00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:10.600
A big tuna!

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.730
There aren't any tuna here...

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:13.690
--Huh? Why?

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:14.650
--This feels great.
I'm usually the indoor type,
--Huh? Why?

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.360
--This feels great.
I'm usually the indoor type,
--Tuna are in the ocean.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.190
--This feels great.
I'm usually the indoor type,
--Boo.

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:18.320
--This feels great.
I'm usually the indoor type,
--That's no fun!

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:21.030
--So I never got to take
Koharu anyplace like this.
--We're catching rainbow trout today.

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:22.320
--So I never got to take
Koharu anyplace like this.
--Rainbow trout?

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.030
--Well... they all look
like they're having fun.
--Rainbow trout?

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.280
--Well... they all look
like they're having fun.
--Yup. That's where your names come from.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:28.870
It's great.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:33.000
Yup. They're great together.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:36.630
A quick salt broil...
Or maybe some meunière!

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.630
Cooking them in foil is an option, too...

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:42.090
I can't wait to try them all!

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:44.880
Well, get fishing.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:46.760
Roger!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.680
There!

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:54.390
You're dashing, Futaba!

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:57.650
A-Aiko...

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:59.610
Hm...

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:01.650
I haven't caught a single one.

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:05.160
I caught so many here last time.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.410
Looks like you haven't caught any.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:08.830
Koi.

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.700
What are you using for your fly?

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.370
What else?

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.710
The Caddis I made myself!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:19.170
Ah... Well, the fish really
aren't biting right now.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:23.010
You should probably change to a nymph
so you can get up close and personal

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.630
